{
  "_readme": [
    "Single source of truth for the game's CONTENT. tools/build.py turns this file",
    "into real instances inside ReplicatedStorage/GameData (plus the map geometry,",
    "menu buttons/frames and RemoteEvents). At runtime nothing reads this JSON:",
    "the server and client read the GameData instances, so after a build you can",
    "tune the game in Studio (values, colours, prices, zones, quests...) without",
    "touching a single line of Lua.",
    "Edit this file only if you want the change to survive a rebuild."
